<section class="container-fluid page-section"><p><a href="<?php echo site_url('kelola/battle/katalog'); ?>">← Antrean katalog battle</a></p><h1 class="h2"><?php echo html_escape($room['title']); ?></h1><p><?php echo nl2br(html_escape($room['public_summary'])); ?></p><p>Sasaran: <?php echo array('primary' => 'SD', 'secondary' => 'SMP', 'all_ages' => 'Lintas jenjang / keluarga')[$room['public_age']]; ?>. <?php echo html_escape(study_format_datetime($room['starts_at'])); ?> — <?php echo html_escape(study_format_datetime($room['ends_at'])); ?>.</p><p>Status katalog: <?php echo html_escape($room['listing_status']); ?>. <?php echo html_escape($room['listing_reason']); ?></p><p>Pengajuan memberi izin tinjauan soal ini, bukan akses jawaban/identitas peserta. Review sendiri hanya diizinkan jika mode operator tunggal di Pengaturan Pembelajaran aktif; checklist tetap wajib.</p>
